#### Example `Spell` class:

```java
public class Spell {
    private String name;
    private int damage;
    private int level;
    private boolean have;
    private int heal;

    public Spell(String name, int damage, int level, boolean have, int heal) {
        this.name = name;
        this.damage = damage;
        this.level = level;
        this.have = have;
        this.heal = heal;
    }

    // Getters
    public String getName() {
        return name;
    }

    public int getDamage() {
        return damage;
    }

    public int getLevel() {
        return level;
    }

    public boolean getHave() {
        return have;
    }

    public int getHeal() {
        return heal;
    }

    // Setters
    public void setDamage(int damage) {
        this.damage = damage;
    }

    public void setLevel(int level) {
        this.level = level;
    }

    public void setHave(boolean have) {
        this.have = have;
    }

    public void setHeal(int heal) {
        this.heal = heal;
    }
}
```

